Package: bluez-utils
Version: 2.10-r4
Description: Linux Bluetooth Stack Userland Utilities.
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Maintainer: OpenEmbedded Team <oe@handhelds.org>
Architecture: armv5te
Source: http://bluez.sourceforge.net/download/bluez-utils-2.10.tar.gz 	file://dbus.patch;patch=1 	file://hcid.conf
